    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629330/extras/35668a39a57a450267edac85777290c9.avif?t=1753886109\" width=630 height=181 /></span><br>MEMOLOGY: GOYDA is a simulation of the Unified State Exam on memes. You will have to answer a large number of questions, after which the game will determine your level of knowledge.<br><br>You are waiting for you:<br>- 50 levels with questions (we are planning to do 100+)<br>- The most powerful memes (on Thursdays)<br>- The opportunity to learn and increase your level of education<br>- Achievements with memes!",
